.DS_Store
# Large, reproducible downloads. Re-fetch with tools/fetch-city-layers.mjs;
# the report PDFs come from the Wayback Machine URLs in SOURCE_NOTES.md.
data/raw/city/
data/raw/docs/*.pdf
# Aerial imagery clips (public City service): large; keep derived counts only.
data/raw/imagery/
# Claude Code worktrees and local settings
.claude/

# Street-widening screening: block-group ACS values (aggregates only); parcel and building geometry is never saved.
data/raw/widening/
# Egress candidates: Overpass responses and lookups (tools/egress-candidates.mjs); re-fetched on demand. Parcel geometry is never saved.
data/raw/egress/
# LANDFIRE download cache (tools/fetch-fuel.mjs); data/terrain/fbfm40.u8 holds the same codes.
data/raw/landfire/
# Wind downloads (tools/wind-events.mjs): Red Flag lists, WRCC pages, OAK ASOS; the summary is data/model/wind-red-flag.json.
data/raw/wind/
# Walk access: building footprint centroids extracted from the Microsoft tile (tools/walk-access.mjs); refetch from the URL in SOURCE_NOTES WA2.
data/raw/walk/

# OSM building outlines (tools/fetch-osm-buildings.mjs): large; geometry only; reduced to per-cell counts in data/model/structures.json.
data/raw/osm/buildings.json
data/raw/osm/buildings-tiles/
# HayWired fire-following data release download (tools/build-haywired.mjs); data/model/haywired-ignitions.json keeps the Berkeley values.
data/raw/usgs/
